// The workflow, as steps:
// 1. Allocations -> Mark Generation (baseline)
// 2. Scroll feed 1 minute
// 3. Mark Generation -> diff: 200 DetailVCs alive (should be ~5)
// 4. Memory graph: DetailVC <- closure <- network task (the cycle)
